@startuml
title Prototype Pattern - Class Diagram

interface "Prototype<T>" as Prototype {
  +clone(): T
}

class Document {
  +title: String
  +content: String
  +author: String
  +Document(title: String, content: String, author: String)
  +clone(): Document
  +print(): void
}

Prototype <|.. Document
Document ..> Document : clones (new instance)

note right of Document
  clone() copies title, content and author
  into a new Document; the original is untouched.
end note

@enduml
